BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 574.55 Tm (system that is non-refundable if the deal dies, which matters because a high percentage of deals do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 559.32 Tm (close for reasons the investor never controlled, plus cancellation fees charged even when the lender never) Tj ET
