0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (expensive moment to discover them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Wire fraud losses are the hardest numbers on the table. Sunny Fedorenko cites a Southern California) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (couple who lost $160,000 and an Orlando couple who lost $38,000 in escrow scams, and says that once a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (wire is gone the bank, the title company and the agent are not responsible [j0SpK9C7lHs @ 00:02:21]. Think) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Escrow describes a buyer in a multiple-offer bidding war who got a fake escrow email demanding an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (immediate good-faith deposit to lock in the purchase, rushed to the bank, drove home happy, and in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (matter of half an hour the funds were already diverted into out-of-state accounts [f-7Rw_JAZOA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (00:10:18]. The same escrow veteran recounts an escrow company that skipped looking at its outgoing wires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (for several days while fraudsters inside its accounting system generated wires in $10,000 and $20,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (increments totaling about $250,000 [f-7Rw_JAZOA @ 00:07:41]. PropLogix's title expert was spoofed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (supposedly ordering an office to wire a large sum, a request built from one internet search of name, email) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (address and company [k03c-6thJPg @ 00:01:46]. Fedorenko adds that hackers now use AI mimicry: cloned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (signatures, hijacked threads, fake PDFs carrying escrow logos, and URLs identical except for one letter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Every loss above started with a message that looked legitimate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (The closing math hides its own traps, and they hit cash to close directly. Matthew Halliday of Escrow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (Escapes tells of a buyer holding the pen who found an extra $800 that turned out to be a special) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (assessment, not routine HOA dues, and rejects the 'just sign and sort it out later' instinct because an unclear) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (amount does not get clearer once the keys are in your hand [kfe6mMfaivM @ 00:04:43]. Julee Felsman) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (flags that Oregon loan estimates frequently omit the property tax proration a buyer owes the seller, so the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (buyer must plan more cash than the lender estimated, and that a title company hold and pay typically) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (collects about 115% of the prior year's bill plus a $60 to $100 tax payment service fee [faIlHE0Vtco @) Tj ET
