BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm ([6bibMzU1L3U @ 00:10:04]. The second failure mode is a runaway operator. Coons's walkthrough cites a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm ($400K demolition horror story. The responses are to bar Party B from exceeding the budget by $8K without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (approval, and to force a listing within 7 days of completion. Price drops are scripted at 8%, then 5% at 60, 90) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (and 120 days, down to a $490K break-even floor, after which the property converts to a rental) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm ([FiBdpAVfzMo @ 00:25:12]. Scott Horne flags the structural trap: a JV built only to dodge usury limits is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (sham. The funder has to genuinely participate or hold real ownership in the LLC or on the deed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm ([XdrwPF-D1FI @ 00:08:27]. Molly Tennant adds that breach is pursued separately, so breach disclosures) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (belong in the agreement up front [TTA8OtC6qJs @ 00:01:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Closing-table failures are where private lenders lose principal without any borrower default. Jason at Hard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Money Mastermind refuses powers of attorney and remote online notaries, and reminds lenders that the title) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (company does not represent them. He verifies the title commitment directly with the insurer. He wires only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (after the HUD-1 and a signed three-to-four-page closing instruction letter are in hand [bNJYDcDSFxU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (00:17:38]. Manuel Angelus at The Real Estate Lender puts it bluntly: an unrecorded lien is a secret between) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (friends. A $38 recording fee is what sets priority, and property taxes still jump ahead of everyone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm ([Bp3FsnPecRY @ 00:02:26]. Angelus also warns that insurance quietly fails mid-loan. Vacancy exclusions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (kick in at 30 to 60 days, builder's risk may be missing, and flood leaves gaps. The lender has to be named) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (mortgagee and loss payee and must reverify coverage during the term, not just at closing [Bp3FsnPecRY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (00:05:58]. William Dolan of Esquire Advice raises the authority trap. Operating agreements often list stale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (managers, so the person signing for the borrowing LLC may have no power to bind it. And once bankruptcy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (hits, unsecured lenders collect little [hy-UeKXcTUA @ 00:04:29].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Rate and default math is the third trap, and it cuts both ways. Ayala Law's live trial involved a $5M balloon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (loan. Delayed refinancing let 21% default interest accrue daily, and a new lender retroactively assessed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (default interest on past late payments under a no-waiver clause. The balance swelled to about $6.4M, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (the lawsuit itself then blocked the refinance [0cBnXayz9w4 @ 00:03:19]. On the lender side, Nema) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (Daghbandan warns about modifications of California loans by an unlicensed holder. Adding rate or points, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (even advancing an extra $50,000 at the same rate, loses the exemption because no licensed party is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (involved anymore. That turns an exempt loan into usury exposure [W1fiiFnsFhE @ 00:04:14]. Scott Horne) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (shows how fees blow up APR. A $50K fee on a $200K six-month loan works out to 50%, and $2,500 on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm ($10K of 30-day earnest money works out to 300%. Texas borrowers can sue for up to about four years for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (interest, principal, fees and possibly treble damages, even after a 60-day savings-clause cure [XdrwPF-D1FI) Tj ET
